invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305_ifma.c
catches: poly1305_equiv_test
reason: digits_of_words keeps digit 0's bits from 44 up after it adds them
  to digit 1, so the accumulator the kernel starts from counts those bits
  twice and the tag is wrong for every update whose prefix leaves them
  set. bin/poly1305_equiv_test runs the kernel's own text over the lane
  model on every host and compares it with poly1305.c's loop, and
  poly1305_ifma_sums proves the digit below 2^44 + 2^17.

--- old
    l0 &= DIGIT_MASK;
--- new
